WEBVTT

00:00:18.703 --> 00:00:21.623
♪ ♪

00:00:30.673 --> 00:00:35.219
♪ Do do-do do-do up. ♪ [humming]

00:00:35.261 --> 00:00:37.179
Come on, man! Hurry it up!

00:00:37.221 --> 00:00:38.180
[panting]

00:00:38.222 --> 00:00:39.181
Okay!

00:00:39.223 --> 00:00:41.016
I'm coming, I'm coming.

00:00:41.058 --> 00:00:41.976
Sheesh.

00:00:44.604 --> 00:00:45.647
[loud rock music playing]

00:00:45.688 --> 00:00:47.857
Welcome, my dogs!

00:00:47.899 --> 00:00:49.191
Oh, you guys look weird.

00:00:49.233 --> 00:00:50.610
Hurry up, come on in!

00:00:50.652 --> 00:00:53.321
♪ We will never do as others do, no ♪

00:00:53.362 --> 00:00:55.907
and we get it from you... ♪ ♪ Know what we want

00:00:55.949 --> 00:00:57.742
You said it was a costume party.

00:00:57.784 --> 00:00:59.535
Why do you listen to me?

00:00:59.577 --> 00:01:02.580
let's get a party going... ♪ ♪ Let's get a party going,

00:01:02.622 --> 00:01:05.500
[grunting, whooping]

00:01:05.541 --> 00:01:07.042
[laughs]

00:01:07.084 --> 00:01:08.210
Yeah!

00:01:08.252 --> 00:01:09.337
[music stops]

00:01:09.378 --> 00:01:12.006
I'm home, Leonard. MAN:

00:01:12.047 --> 00:01:14.008
[keys jingling, lock clicking]

00:01:14.049 --> 00:01:15.885
[door opens, closes]

00:01:15.927 --> 00:01:18.304
[gentle classical music playing]

00:01:18.346 --> 00:01:20.807
Were you a good boy, Leonard?

00:01:22.475 --> 00:01:23.142
[snorts]

00:01:24.143 --> 00:01:31.233
♪ ♪

00:06:08.385 --> 00:06:09.178
[music ends]

00:06:10.263 --> 00:06:11.555
All right, party's over! POPS:

